{"availability":"available","full":"CalinGraphics/VitaBalance","name":"VitaBalance","description":"Personalised nutrition recommendations from your profile and lab results.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-18T18:36:56Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:25:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vita-balance-app.vercel.app","topics":["fastapi","healthtech","nutrition","postgresql","python","react","recommender-system","supabase","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://vita-balance-app.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:43:54.439Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:43:54.439Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:43:54.439Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.786Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T15:43:54.439Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Explainable food recommendations that target your actual nutrient deficits while respecting your diet, allergies and medical conditions.","Features · How it works · Architecture · Getting started · API · Security","VitaBalance is a full-stack web application that turns a user's profile and blood test results into a short, ranked list of foods that cover their nutritional gaps. Every recommendation comes with a patient-specific explanation (which lab value is low, how much of the daily need one portion covers, why it is safe for this user), so the result is something you can understand and verify, not a black box."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CalinGraphics/VitaBalance/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b00702b8ecec1fe227031d4537ba75a0c5c80e9728a826bb7a73bb86fda61836","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.931Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.931Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Explainable food recommendations that target your actual nutrient deficits while respecting your diet, allergies and medi